331+  0208              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
332+  0208              ; Resident command-dispatch entry, one bounded unit of work.
333+  0208              ; OUT: carry clear/Z=1/A=0 when no command is pending;
334+  0208              ;      carry clear/Z=0 with HL=#C000, BC=size on a valid E0h frame;
335+  0208              ;      carry set/A=status for a rejected command or receive failure.
336+  0208              ; The caller owns the resident main loop and must keep its stack/code outside
337+  0208              ; WIN3. E0h is consumed from ZXCMD while CBIT stays asserted until DMA is armed.
338+  0208              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
339+  0208              P126_NGS_ZXCMD       EQU #01
340+  0208
